# What git keeps but the semantic index should not carry: generated output and
# desktop build artefacts. `.gitignore` already covers target/ and node_modules/.
#
# `docs/` is deliberately absent from this list — the workshop notebooks are
# meant to be findable. Revisit that only if the fault table becomes data in the
# store, because indexing a rendering would then hold the same thing twice.

target/
desktop/node_modules/
desktop/dist/
desktop/src-tauri/target/
*.lock
Cargo.lock
desktop/package-lock.json

# Renders and window mock-ups. `design/` also holds a-single-delivery.md, which
# is prose about how the product is delivered and stays indexed; these are
# pictures of a window and the HTML that drew them. sailor-la-finestra.html
# alone is 2.5 MB, a seventh of every tracked byte in the tree.
design/rendered/
design/*.html
design/canvas.json
